      "source": "Callback interface for Redis 'low level' code. To be used with <a href=\"RedisTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>RedisTemplate</code></a> execution methods, often as\nanonymous classes within a method implementation. Usually, used for chaining several operations together (\n<code>get/set/trim etc...</code>.",
      "translation": "Redis 底层代码的回调接口。用于与<a href=\"RedisTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>RedisTemplate</code></a>的执行方法配合使用，通常在方法实现中作为匿名类出现。一般用于将多个操作串联起来（如<code>get/set/trim 等...</code>）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/DataAccessException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao\">DataAccessException</a></code> - if the operation performed by the callback fails to execute in the context of Redis\n          using the given <a href=\"../connection/RedisConnection.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnection</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/DataAccessException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao\">DataAccessException</a></code> - 如果回调操作在给定 <a href=\"../connection/RedisConnection.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnection</code></a> 的上下文中执行 Redis 时失败。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
